## Architecture Layers: Utilities → CSS → Components

### Layer 1: Utility Classes (Tailwind)
```html
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
  <!-- Layout only -->
</div>
```

### Layer 2: Control CSS Classes
```css
/* src/styles.css */
.input { @apply w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg; }
.btn-primary { @apply px-4 py-2 bg-brand-red-600 text-white rounded-lg; }
```

### Layer 3: Angular Components (Built with Controls + Utilities)
```html
<form class="card p-6 space-y-6"> <!-- CSS class + utilities -->
  <input class="input" formControlName="address" /> <!-- CSS class for control -->
  <button class="btn-primary" type="submit">Submit</button> <!-- CSS class -->
</form>
```

