## Summary

✅ **DO:**
- Use angular-cli MCP server tools (`list_projects`, `get_best_practices`, `search_documentation`)
- Use standalone components (default in v21)
- Use Angular Signals for reactive state
- Use modern template syntax (@if, @for, @switch)
- Use typed reactive forms
- Use Dependency Injection for services
- Follow three-layer architecture: utilities → CSS classes → components
- Use RxJS for async operations

❌ **DON'T:**
- Skip MCP server workflow (list_projects → get_best_practices → code)
- Use NgModules (unless maintaining legacy code)
- Use BehaviorSubject for local state (use signals)
- Use old structural directives (*ngIf, *ngFor) in new code
- Use inline Tailwind for controls (use CSS classes)
- Hardcode API URLs (use environment files)
- Run `ng` commands without MCP context
